      "content": "i hear you, but it’s not that simple. i don't want to \"build something new\" from the wreckage of my reputation. there's no dignity in being the guy who's constantly struggling just to survive after a massive failure. it feels like the only way to stop the descent and actually keep my head held high is to just... stop before the impact happens. like, wouldn't it be better to leave while there's still a shred of who i was left, instead of waiting to become a total wreck?",
